ods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","review_id":"ewBgRhe0MZb2VAXNB4PdFw","date":"2015-02-03T17:52:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9645406007766724,"text_excerpt":"Yes, this place is worth all the high ratings and long wait. Acme Oyster House is an institution and came recommended from a colleague/friend as well as fellow Yelpers. When I called last Friday night, there was an automated answering machine saying they do not take reservations. Somehow, my colleague called and someone said it would be a 20 minute wait. We estimate we approached Acme from where we were staying in the Central Business District at 8 pm and thought the line didn't look too bad. It wasn't until 8:40 pm before we sat down. I think Leslie was our server and she was awesome. She didn't miss a beat and in that respect was super quick when she could have slowed down. For instance..."},{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","review_id":"VJ0X5xADDQEz0Mpnr58r7g","date":"2016-11-21T00:31:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9551969766616821,"text_excerpt":"For our last night in town, we decided to grab dinner at Acme Oyster House. It's extremely popular (evidenced by the number of Yelp reviews, along with the long line out the door). We showed up a little early and were told we had about a 15-20 minute wait - not really that bad for a large party. We got seated in the middle of the restaurant at a long table, and the service was pretty decent - food came out pretty quickly, as did the beers (in plastic cups, making it easy to carry out on the streets). The food here is quite solid as well, but I would give a hearty recommendation to NOT get the oysters raw. I've never had Texas oysters before, and now I think I understand why - when served ..."},{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","review_id":"gzCrqrlu9Q3Bm8P2Vjjx6A","date":"2011-12-09T22:12:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9548299312591553,"text_excerpt":"Known for its chargrilled oysters...mmm Also, if you just don't think about what you're eating, I would recommend Boo Fries. Fries smothered in gravy and cheese; I definitely did not regret it after eating, but I probably should have. There was a line to get in when it was cold and raining. We were seated near the door, so everytime it open, we were blasted with a gust of cold air. But service was good, hostess was on top of her game. I especially loved the fact they shucked the oysters right behind the bar in the front. Definitely gave it a more homey feel. I will definitely come back when I return to NOLA."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","photo_id":"vkr8T0scuJmGVvN2HJelEA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vkr8T0scuJmGVvN2HJelEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.894852340221405},{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","photo_id":"ZSCGIIIAUpmg0_x_YLQVDA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZSCGIIIAUpmg0_x_YLQVDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8766002655029297},{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw","photo_id":"cPHykFAL66oiDkgUBg4ctw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cPHykFAL66oiDkgUBg4ctw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8210126757621765},{"business_id":"_ab50qdWOk0DdB6XOrBitw